  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Whispers follow 'Bonechill' Barry through the ravaged streets of Subchain City. Some say he was a high-roller who bled out his entire fortune on cryo-enhancements, others claim he's a walking omen of the coming deep freeze. Truth is, Barry just remembers waking up one day...cold.",
    "class": "Cryo-Mercenary",
    "name": "Bonechill Barry",
    "personality": "Cynical and detached, Barry's seen too much DRIP spill to care about anything beyond his next score. He has a dry, gallows humor and a disturbingly calm demeanor even in the midst of a firefight. His soft spot is that he secretly tries to help new ducklings that he meets.",
